-- Correct councils.last_election_year to the year of each council's latest scheduled (whole or partial) council
-- election in Democracy Club's elections list (elections.democracyclub.org.uk, read 18 Oct 2026). By-elections do not
-- count: an election counts when at least one of its ballots is not a by-election. North Yorkshire and Somerset: the
-- 5 May 2022 elections were held for the county councils that became these unitary councils.
-- 17 councils hold a different year; 159 hold none. Old rows kept in public.councils_backup_20261018e.
-- Each UPDATE must change exactly one row still holding the old value, or the whole file rolls back.
--   council: before -> after (election date)
--   bath-and-north-east-somerset: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-06-22)
--   bracknell-forest: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   cornwall: 2021 -> 2025 (2025-05-01)
--   derby: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   dorset: 2025 -> 2024 (2024-05-02)
--   luton: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   medway: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   middlesbrough: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   north-somerset: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   north-yorkshire: 2025 -> 2022 (2022-05-05)
--   redcar-and-cleveland: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   somerset: 2025 -> 2022 (2022-05-05)
--   south-gloucestershire: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   stoke-on-trent: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   surrey: 2025 -> 2021 (2021-05-06)
--   west-berkshire: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
--   windsor-and-maidenhead: 2024 -> 2023 (2023-05-04)
